ation\n\nUndoing the inversion $\\mathcal I$, the line through $H$ parallel to $AP$ (the pre\u2011image of the external symmedian at $B$) is tangent to the original circumcircle of $\\triangle BEF$ at $B$. This completes the proof. \u220e"
