n### Conclusion\n\nBy Lemma\u202f5 the line through the orthocenter \\(H\\) of \\(\\triangle PMN\\) that is parallel to \\(AP\\) touches the circumcircle of \\(\\triangle BEF\\) at \\(B\\).  This is exactly the statement to be proved. \u220e"
